            {
                "drawing_id": "4ae8a99e-bc22-4c4b-8ada-9d23c2f2205b",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg height=\"344\" width=\"619\"><text fill=\"#5500ff\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\" font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\">Step 1: Start a packet capture on the link between R1 and SW1\n\nStep 2: Use R1 to generate unicast and broadcast traffic in the network\n\nStep 3: Generate some unknown unicast traffic in the network.\n How will this traffic look (compared to the known unicast traffic)\n in the packet capture? \n\nStep 4: Examine the packet capture and identify unicast, broadcast,\n and multicast messages \n\nStep 5: Disable MAC address aging on SW1\n\nStep 6: Statically configure R1's MAC address on SW1\n\n</text></svg>",
                "x": -899,
                "y": -254,
                "z": 2
            }
